   130	   * Always passed explicitly to `Bun.serve` so container bootstraps bind a
   131	   * predictable IPv4 wildcard regardless of the platform default
   132	   * (`@effect/platform-bun` ≥ 4.0.0-rc.115 defaults to `::`; rc.113/114
   133	   * crash-looped on the omitted-hostname case).
   134	   *
